# Delete from the command menu on an Overdue entry being edited deletes it and leaves navigate mode on the next entry.
file <<END
- Aa @due({today-2})
- Bb @due({today-1})
END
keys gO <Enter> /
type delete
keys <Enter>
hide Aa
see ▌ - Bb
keys x
quit
saved <<END
- Bb @due({today-1}) @done({today})
END
